{
  "_": [
    "First names the people-gate in check-leaks.mjs recognises. It fires on",
    "a name from this list followed by a capitalised word — i.e. a full",
    "name — and the pair then has to be declared in fixture-personas.json.",
    "",
    "Spanish and English, because those are the languages this product's",
    "teachers, students and readers actually use. It is a detector's",
    "dictionary and belongs to nobody: adding a name here does not say a",
    "person of that name exists, it says the gate should notice one.",
    "",
    "Widen it when a fixture arrives in a language it does not cover. A",
    "name it does not know is a hole, and the hole is the point of the",
    "roster being short enough to read."
